  "notes": [
    "Four complete Ghidra-analyzed void bodies and the previously reconstructed AL-only upgrade predicate.",
    "4C3420 creates three linked three-by-three parts, then resolves the root, decorates the footprint and updates the Bast city field only for category4.",
    "4C0BE0 iterates seven rows of thirteen decoration cells; zero entries skip both stamping and terrain refresh.",
    "4C0D50 follows signed WORD next links, caches root orientation, reloads view rotation per part, and ignores the image offset for active upgrades.",
    "4C0860 checks translated coordinates using AL, then reloads map origin and writes ordered image, flags, ownership and terrain fields.",
    "The initial predicate is already ordinary C in src/unit_01606.c; its duplicate register-model adapter is retired here."
  ]
